<title>USA: S&amp;P names Joseph Hu structured finance director.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P names Joseph Hu structured finance director.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said Thursday it had named Joseph Hu as a director in its structured finance research group.</p>
<p>Hu will report to Tom Gillis, managing director of structured finance at S&amp;P, the agency said.</p>
<p>Prior to joining S&amp;P, Hu worked as head of mortgage-backed securities research for Oppenheimer and Co.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
